"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei:p002","quote":"緯尙宋文帝第五女長城公主，素爲綜、約所憎，免死，徙廣州，孝建中還都。方雅有父風，位正員郎。子朓。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei:p002:m0046","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei:p002:m0000","source_term":"子朓"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"傳主緯，末言子朓，繼後朓字玄暉。"}},{"id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBAA","label":"謝謨","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"謨","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0037","c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0071","c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0099","c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0132"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xietiao-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008","quote":"謨","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0037"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xietiao-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008","quote":"謨","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0071"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xietiao-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008","quote":"謨","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0099"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xietiao-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008","quote":"謨","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0132"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"謝朓子，初娶梁武第二女永世公主。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-tiao-mo","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xietiao-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008","quote":"朓及殷叡素與梁武以文章相得，帝以大女永興公主適叡子鈞，第二女永世公主適朓子謨。及帝爲雍州，二女並暫隨母向州。及武帝即位，二主始隨內還。武帝意薄謨，又以門單，欲更適張弘策子，弘策卒，又以與王志子諲。而謨不堪歎恨，爲書狀如詩贈主。主以呈帝，甚蒙矜歎，而婦終不得還。尋用謨爲信安縣，稍遷王府諮議。時以爲沈約早與朓善，爲制此書雲。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0037","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0035","source_term":"朓子謨"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"本句並有兩個姓名錨點。"}},{"id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_B","label":"蕭玉婉","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"玉婉","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses:p002:m0018"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-007","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses","source_id":"s-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses-ws1566494","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses:p002","quote":"玉婉","mention_id":"c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses:p002:m0018"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"梁武第二女永世公主。《梁書》7記個人名。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-tiao-wan-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xietiao-ws1531762","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008","quote":"朓及殷叡素與梁武以文章相得，帝以大女永興公主適叡子鈞，第二女永世公主適朓子謨。及帝爲雍州，二女並暫隨母向州。及武帝即位，二主始隨內還。武帝意薄謨，又以門單，欲更適張弘策子，弘策卒，又以與王志子諲。而謨不堪歎恨，爲書狀如詩贈主。主以呈帝，甚蒙矜歎，而婦終不得還。尋用謨爲信安縣，稍遷王府諮議。時以爲沈約早與朓善，爲制此書雲。","source_term":"帝以大女永興公主適叡子鈞，第二女永世公主適朓子謨"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"原文直接記梁武帝大女或第二女，又以梁書郗后傳覆核公主姓名。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xietiao-ws1531762","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao","raw_mention_count":4,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0037","c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0071","c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0099","c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0132"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":